-- What `l4 render` does with the shape of a document: the words of a provision
-- kept among its conditions, negative wording an author chose, decision tables,
-- the interpretation section, schedules and citations.

IMPORT prelude

@ref-map Grants Act 2024, s 4(1) https://example.com/Acts/Grants#S4

§ `House style`

ASSUME `the person is a hotel` IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME `the person is licensed` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE Transfer HAS
  `to the issuer of the securities` IS A BOOLEAN
  `to an accredited investor` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE Status IS ONE OF Active, Dormant, Closed

GIVEN transfer IS A Transfer
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`transfer falls within an exception` transfer MEANS
        "where such securities are transferred:"
    ..  "(1)" ... transfer's `to the issuer of the securities`
    OR  "(2)" ... transfer's `to an accredited investor`

-- With no wording of its own, a negation stays outside the statement.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`plain negation` MEANS NOT `the person is a hotel`

-- An author who wants a negative wording writes it.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg the person is not a hotel
`not a hotel` MEANS NOT `the person is a hotel`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`may hold a licence` MEANS `not a hotel` AND `the person is licensed`

GIVEN status IS A Status
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the fee by status` MEANS
  CONSIDER status
    WHEN Active THEN 10
    WHEN Dormant THEN 20
    OTHERWISE 30

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
`the age band` MEANS
  IF age AT LEAST 65
    THEN "senior"
    ELSE IF age AT LEAST 18
      THEN "adult"
      ELSE "minor"

GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the rate table` MEANS LIST 1, 2, 3, 4, 5

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rate for` n MEANS at `the rate table` n

@ref Grants Act 2024, s 4(1)
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is eligible` age MEANS age AT LEAST 18

-- Beside a pattern's words, an input's name would read as more of them. One of a
-- built-in type is a blank to fill, and one of a user's type reads as the body
-- calls it. So does an input passed on to a sentence or a pattern.
GIVEN status IS A Status
      `assessed on` IS A NUMBER
      `expiring on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the later schedule applies to` status `when assessed on` `assessed on` `and the pass expires on` `expiring on` IF
  CONSIDER status
    WHEN Active THEN `assessed on` AT LEAST 2027
    OTHERWISE `expiring on` AT LEAST 2028

GIVEN `on date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the later schedule applies to an active case` `on date` MEANS
  `the later schedule applies to` Active `when assessed on` `on date` `and the pass expires on` 0

DECLARE `C1 Sector` IS ONE OF Finance, Other

GIVEN sector IS A `C1 Sector`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the band for` sector MEANS 1
